sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as MySQL
  Customer->>UI: Select service/provider/slot
  UI->>API: POST /api/bookings + JWT
  API->>API: Authenticate and authorize customer
  API->>DB: Validate entities, availability, conflict
  alt valid
    API->>DB: INSERT confirmed booking / COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 201 booking
  else invalid/conflict
    API-->>UI: 401/403/404/409/422
  end
